Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other leads,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we should at least try\Nusing the Stratumlord coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Menagerie of Fools has four coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Origin, Dead, Clearflow, Labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're packing three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearflow, Scorching, and lastly, Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have seven coins total, but two are\Nclear flow and we're missing Dog Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, still worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it won't let us through\Nwithout the Dog Mountain coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old box?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear said we\Nshould only open this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when we had finally made\Nit to the inner depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the doggy coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Sly Bear came\Nthrough for us. Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told his old team were the\Nonly ones to ever defeat Dog Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so my hopes were sky high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the biggest and best bear I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the plug device, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real MVP, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.72,0:01:41.76,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tough dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:02:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can pass on to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in the air, you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.39,0:02:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot the rush, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't wait. I can't\Nwait. You can't see me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.12,0:02:53.04,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,431)\fscx82\pos(431,54.4)}The Beginning of the End
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we go,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's make sure we're on the same\Npage about the wishes we want granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our little family only has a single wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To remove decay, Kai's negative blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we can get another,\NI want a hot girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so selfish, I'll take one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extra hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dearest wish has already come true, so\NI'll happily yield mine to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a spare, I'll\Ntake a castle of boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me eat until I'm about\Nto burst it, we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Pity had a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The line has already come true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I do have a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, it is something\NI must win for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something I want,\Nbut it's not for me to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm up to bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went to beat you again. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cap goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting my non-existent foot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a chance\Nwe'll only get one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other\Ndungeons in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you don't end up getting\Nyour wish granted here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that just means we get to go\Nand conquer some other dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be with you every\Nstep of the way. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These straps aren't budging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where Master goes, I follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pray not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been walking a\Nwhile, but it's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to tell how big this place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the lights are on, but nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have done well to make it here, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a reward for reaching\Nthe lowest stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall grant you whatever\Nwish your heart desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's really gonna do the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense that one of\Nyou standing before me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is more than capable of\Nthreatening my dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you're referring to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to work for the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord seeks to seize my dungeon,\Nconstructed from the sacred tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our fool has already\Nstolen most of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that old guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heed my warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking purple's a real pain, so\Nhow's about I just give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slap my bum and call me Sally!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in a million years did I think some
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dumb kiddos would show\Nup and storm my dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to go on break, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's giving jaded office worker who hates\Nhis life and copes by trolling in forums.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not how I pictured the Dungeon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the one in charge\Nof this nasty little dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy those in the\Nknow call the Dungeon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:05:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they used to throw around words like\Ngenius and visionary, but I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm forgetting my manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, you can rest your keisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've got a boatload\Nof questions to ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an open book, so if\Nit's in my power to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind giving you folks the exposition\Ndump, but let's get some snacks going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.79,0:06:24.92,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H7F825E&\3c&HDEECF7&\fs25}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been curious about\Nthese here thingamabobbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a stalwart vending machine, I'm\Nthe head honcho of feeding folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, taking ownership of edibles keeps\Nmy pals safe from any drink tampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hear what\Nquestions you've got cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what's the deal with\Ndungeons and dungeon masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting right to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dungeons are basically just\Nvanglorious works of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Created by ancient wizards to\Nshow off our ancient wizardry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could think of them\Nas recreational facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.97,0:07:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dungeon master is the\Nindividual who made the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ancient wizards making dungeon art?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, seems like I\Nwould have heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wizards died out for reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, history has forgotten\Nus and the world with it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old wizards made these dungeons to brag
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about how cool they were\Nfor making dungeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never would have guessed\Nthis world had its
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own equivalent to modern game developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that for\Nreaching the lowest level,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll grant any wish our hearts desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many wishes do we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can technically make as many\Nas you want. There's no maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't mean you\Ncan have anything and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granting a wish consumes an amount of mana\Nthat's proportional to its wow factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means your wishes\Nare only limited by the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amount of mana contained\Nwithin this dungeon of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have the power to remove\Nmy son's negative blessing? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish for you to free him from his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better untwist those britches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done explaining\Nall the fine print yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say you wish for a bunch of\Nsilver gold and jewels in obscene piles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fork over my entire personal treasure\Ntrove without using a single lick of mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,removing a negative blessing is gonna eat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up a huge slice of this\Ndungeon's mana pie. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I have one last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you cure Kai's decay and\Nalso turn Boxxo human again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it by the skin of my\Nteeth, but after those two,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be completely out of mana and\Nunable to grant you any further wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, am I about to rejoin humanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is what you're doing, Poxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve every happiness, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Poxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can make my wish\Nwith a clear conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One skin for the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had my hopes up, but I never\Nreally thought it would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pinch me, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be warned,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I do grant those wishes of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this dungeon will collapse\Nand crush everything within.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, we were this close to\Nmaking Boxxo human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the dungeon collapses, it'll flatten\Nmy friends into tragic tortillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That price is too steep to\Nmake my selfish wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your witch-ka-ikang-o-la-et-er.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to start by\Nremoving the boy's negative
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blessing Then you'll\Nevacuate all your little
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends And make the journey\Nback here by yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting you make your wish\Nguilt-free He's either
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amazing at guessing or\Nhe can read my mind like
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu It seems the Netherlord\Nhas sealed the dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exit just to be a jerk\NBut I can temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open it again Then we've\Ngot a plan Good thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll go ahead\Nand remove this boy's Decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Scorch's blessing of\Ndecay is gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never again have to suffer the\Ntorment of feeling his flesh rotting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing binding you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not need your magic,\Nbut I choose to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's where you were hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I didn't know about any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I never expected this\Nplan to work out so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fruits of victory are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granting such a wish drained\Na great deal of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can now finally extinguish\Nhis life with relative ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a foul trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stoop to such depths just\Nto get past my anti-monster barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've sent more of your\Npower away, Dungeon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your precious dungeon is\Npractically in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used me to sneak your way in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I make use of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare objectify her! Zorin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,given your loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to make an exception\Nand allow you to return to my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old me would have been more than\Nhappy to go crawling back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not that girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have something\Nthat's far more dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentimental fool. Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you erased it with eye breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't let you kill off a young lady\Nwho might join our family one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got the captain's\Neye breach and my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paired with their gimmicks, we\Nmight actually stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be amusing to continue this\Nbattle, but I have already achieved my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin a different game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind of magic has you there\Nfeels like a four on the Richter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freaking them out because\Nthey've never felt an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, you'll\Ncause this dungeon to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I intend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got what I came for,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means I have absolutely no\Nreason to preserve this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll move the monsters to the\Nsurface and watch as the humans die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just get a hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters solely exist to\Ninflict pain and spread sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:12:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Demon Lord has strayed from this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing which comes\Nfirst, the collapse or your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without killing us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm going to conjure a\Ntransfer circle for you folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will transport you back to\Nthe Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back there and take everyone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escape the dungeon while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my remaining power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll release the door leading\Nto the surface so you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much\Nlonger my power will last,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it wouldn't be a bad idea to\Nhot-foot it out of here, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This old man wizard is going\Nto sacrifice himself for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, sorry I couldn't grant\Nyour wish and make you a real boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ike, H for Ike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fascinating fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to keep the dungeon from\Ncollapsing for as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I can't make any promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Dungeon Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, that pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever a dungeon is conquered,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dungeon Master grants the\Nwishes, then vanishes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived longer than anyone should.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect it to end like this, but at\Nthe very least, it's worth a good laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I wasn't able to grant that wish\Nof yours, but here, a parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May a promising future\Nawait the brave hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who I had the honor of\Ncrossing paths with today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They who conquered the\Ndungeon of the Sacred Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.57,0:14:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining my\Ndungeon to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a real home and a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never could have imagined\Nit would come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate everyone\Nto the Origin Stratum now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them out of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Might Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, Voxo, our top priority is\Nsecuring the door leading outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, Director Bear, there's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.91,0:15:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross monsters are swarming the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to evacuate in small groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you all into charcoal\Nand use you to warm our clipsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver King 14! Eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking out's a waste of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep the calm, cool,\Nand collected vibes going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uranu's got game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost got everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Methinks our battle montage\Nwill buy us just enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, I wish I had some wood to knock on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have underestimated\Nyour team's tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find your efforts quite riveting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll briefly release\Nmy hold on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest joy in hunting\Ncomes from cornering your prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and watching them squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a nasty piece of work, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew she'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time for a form change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the biggest\Nvending machine in Japan.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.01,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\pos(320,124)\c&HFAEDF9&\bord0\shad0\t(65,232,\c&H5F8BD8&)\frx36\fry0}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you dare to defy me,\Nmagic item known as Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we're both well aware, you\Ncannot maintain that form for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using my barrier in this form\Nis blowing through my points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm loaded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got points to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is fill your coffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please add this gift to your point total.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dungeon Master gifted me\Nhis entire treasure trove.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe how\Nmany zeroes I'm packing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this barrier up until\Nevery last person gets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get left\Nbehind if you don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not gonna like this,\Nbut it's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the int to my indigo! I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're staying, I am too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo has a better chance of coming\Nback safely if we're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, right? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave him! We're a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we'd only be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So put your faith in him, and\Nlet's go. I don't wanna. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be sad, Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dying's not on my Dead\Nlist, but winning is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why, no matter what,\NI won't let you in the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be selfish anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'd better come\Nback to me in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.53,0:19:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you die, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you get buried, I promise\NI'll come and dig you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you've got to do is wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sacrificing yourself\Nto save your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your determination amuses me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I encourage you to consider something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been lurking within the\Nconfines of a bracer upon Saurim's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.53,0:19:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is an extension of me and\Nstill very much attached to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you why this\Nmatters. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo and the Netherlord, what\Nthe heck? Didn't we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.93,0:19:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That jerk forced Sulream to use\Nher Blessing of Transference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.09,0:19:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, bony bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Kerioyl,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you use your blessing of\NEyebreach to remove that barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to watch your\Nson and future daughter-in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's burst open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, don't give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a brave son you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse my command and you both die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or erase the barrier\Nand I'll let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I removed the barrier myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us delight in watching as this\Npermusing magic item is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the call, and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,979 damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:20:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.87,0:21:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,979 damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been decreased by 979.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are no longer able to\Nsustain your current form.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revenue to original model.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.03,0:22:08.65,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.65,0:22:12.62,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.78,0:22:17.66,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.57,0:22:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a story that I'm going\Nto be a new one. I'm waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a new one. I'm waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, I'm going to feel you like you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a good idea. I'm\Ngoing to be a new one. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not going to be a new one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a new one
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.07,0:23:40.11,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.07,0:23:40.11,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\pos(437.2,299.8)\fsp.6}As an Apprentice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

